## Quick Reference: Prompt Patterns

| Pattern | When to Use | Key Ingredient |
|---------|-------------|----------------|
| **Extract → Table** | Pulling structured data from unstructured text | Explicit field list + "Not reported" fallback |
| **Summarise → Audience** | Condensing long documents | Name the audience, specify structure |
| **Classify → Fixed Categories** | Triaging, tagging, bucketing | Define categories explicitly |
| **Search → Cite Source** | Finding answers in pasted documents | "Use only the document; quote the clause" |
| **Draft → Format + Tone** | Writing reports, emails, commentary | Specify format, tone, and audience |
| **Compare → Criteria Table** | Vendor evaluation, option analysis | Fix the criteria; add context for recommendation |
| **Flag → Rules + Fallback** | Anomaly detection, review | Define rules; add "none found" instruction |

