## Tips for DBS Finance Specifically

**Always include your cost centre or entity context** when the output will be used in a specific business context. Claude doesn't know whether you're in Group Finance, IBG Finance, or Treasury — tell it.

**For regulated outputs** (MAS submissions, external disclosures), always have a human reviewer verify the output. Use AI to draft and accelerate, not to sign off.

**Chain your prompts** for complex tasks. Don't ask Claude to extract, analyse, and write a recommendation in one prompt. Do it in steps: extract first, then analyse, then draft.

**Paste data as text, not screenshots.** Claude reads text, not images of spreadsheets. Export to CSV or copy-paste from Excel for best results.

